# Downloaded archives and derived datasets. Reproducible from the adapters,
# large, and never a source of truth.
#
# LEADING SLASH IS LOAD-BEARING: an unanchored "data/" also matches
# src/zentrade/adapters/data/, which silently excluded the entire data-adapter
# package from version control until this was caught.
/data/
